Subject: [PATCH] Prefer decoder CPU copying and report native UHD activity

Use the already validated synchronous CPU-copy path by default for decoder
exports while preserving explicit overrides and the encoder's GPU default.
Publish only decoder activity through an asynchronous native client. The
per-user policy service authenticates the sender and expires stale reports;
no URL, browser profile, user ID, frame payload or firmware value is sent.
Keep all existing decoder completion, DMA-BUF fence and cache maintenance.

Base: libva-v4l2 6d03c3f8fb19b86f84b2b6c60ff20d1402f0ac41 plus patches0001-0006.
License: MIT, matching the modified upstream files.

